Dialogue: 10,0:00:03.32,0:00:04.32,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Fujinuma Satoru,
Dialogue: 10,0:00:04.76,0:00:08.81,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,you are under arrest for murder and\Nattempted murder resulting from arson.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:24.17,0:00:25.16,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's him!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:28.99,0:00:29.89,GJM_Main,,0,0,143,,{\i1}It can't end like this.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:36.81,0:00:38.09,GJM_Main,,0,0,143,,{\i1}I still have unfinished business.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:41.37,0:00:43.40,GJM_Main,,0,0,143,,{\i1}There's still something I have to do.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:48.95,0:00:50.16,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:50.93,0:00:51.75,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Go back...
Dialogue: 10,0:00:53.51,0:00:54.83,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I need to go back...
Dialogue: 10,0:00:56.24,0:00:57.83,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Just one more time...
Dialogue: 10,0:00:58.29,0:00:59.04,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Please...
Dialogue: 10,0:01:00.71,0:01:02.00,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I beg of you!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:03.38,0:01:07.05,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Go back!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:32.49,0:01:34.85,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I'm glad I mustered up the courage to come.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:38.00,0:01:39.16,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I'm really...
Dialogue: 10,0:01:40.25,0:01:41.29,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,really glad.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:42.46,0:01:43.90,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Are you stupid?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:43.90,0:01:45.74,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:45.74,0:01:46.66,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Satoru.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:46.66,0:01:47.76,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Hinazuki.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:47.76,0:01:48.82,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Hey there!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:48.82,0:01:51.10,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I got done early, so I came.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:51.10,0:01:52.35,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Sorry we're late.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:53.98,0:01:55.10,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Are we interrupting?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:55.10,0:01:56.81,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Of course not.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:56.81,0:01:57.95,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Right, Hinazuki?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:57.95,0:01:58.45,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:58.45,0:01:59.63,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I must succeed...
Dialogue: 10,0:02:01.72,0:02:04.38,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}This time, for sure.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:04.93,0:02:07.86,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Even if I have to do it alone, even if things get ugly,
Dialogue: 10,0:02:07.86,0:02:09.22,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I can't have any regrets.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:09.85,0:02:12.01,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I won't get another chance if I fail.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:13.70,0:02:15.50,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}This is the final Revival!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:47.54,0:03:49.24,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I'm starving.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:49.24,0:03:50.32,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Why don't we grab a bite?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:50.32,0:03:51.89,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I'm broke.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:51.89,0:03:56.52,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, I got some pocket money.\NWanna go for some pancakes? My treat.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:56.95,0:03:58.73,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Sure!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:57.22,0:03:58.73,GJM_Overlap,,0,0,0,,Nicely done, Satoru!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:58.73,0:04:00.52,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:00.52,0:04:03.98,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, Satoru. Did you read that book\NI lent you a couple weeks ago?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:03.98,0:04:04.94,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:04.94,0:04:07.85,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,"The Switched Man" by Poe.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:07.85,0:04:09.86,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Not yet, sorry.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:10.24,0:04:11.41,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I don't remember that.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:12.11,0:04:14.64,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}How would I remember a book\NI borrowed 18 years ago, anyway?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:15.29,0:04:19.00,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Give it a try once you get home.\NIt's really interesting.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:21.45,0:04:22.83,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I'm home.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:22.83,0:04:24.65,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Welcome back, Satoru.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:25.55,0:04:29.07,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Gimme a sec. Dinner will be done soon.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:31.72,0:04:34.68,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,What's wrong, Satoru? Don't just stand there—
Dialogue: 10,0:04:38.10,0:04:40.19,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Did you get into a fight with Kayo-chan?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:41.27,0:04:43.15,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Nah. I'm good.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:44.09,0:04:45.36,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,That so?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:45.36,0:04:46.91,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Well, let's eat.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:51.94,0:04:54.82,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Mom, but could you keep this in mind?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:56.10,0:04:59.79,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You can actually take a direct train to Ueno.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:01.38,0:05:02.81,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,What're you even talking about?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:06.33,0:05:09.10,GJM_Main,,0,0,51,,February 29th, 1988.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:09.93,0:05:14.79,GJM_Main,,0,0,51,,The day before Hinazuki becomes the first victim\Nin the serial kidnapping and murder case.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:15.51,0:05:17.73,GJM_Main,,0,0,51,,This makes it my third time living this day.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:17.73,0:05:20.23,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You've got guts, Satoru-kun!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:20.55,0:05:23.31,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}He said the same thing last time,\Nbut now it's a day early.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:25.46,0:05:27.27,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I can't be picky about my methods this time.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:30.79,0:05:31.65,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Kenya.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:31.65,0:05:35.70,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Uh, I'm sorry, but I think \NI lost that book you lent me.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:36.31,0:05:39.29,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Let's talk out in the hall, Satoru.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:40.13,0:05:42.17,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You don't have to worry about the book.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:43.00,0:05:44.62,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,It never existed in the first place.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:46.94,0:05:49.25,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Let me just get this out of the way, Satoru.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:49.79,0:05:53.43,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Lately, I've been catching glimpses\Nof a more serious side to you.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:53.43,0:05:55.63,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,And that makes me happy.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:56.80,0:06:01.67,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Before, you pretended to care about others\Ndespite having no interest in them, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:02.32,0:06:04.98,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you did your best with that, too...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:05.62,0:06:08.27,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,But I like you better as you are now.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:09.23,0:06:13.24,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,However, there's a question that's eating\Naway at me that I still want answered.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:16.07,0:06:17.74,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Satoru...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:17.74,0:06:19.15,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:21.20,0:06:24.70,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,It feels to me like you've become a different person,
Dialogue: 10,0:06:24.70,0:06:28.29,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,or rather, like there's another personality mixed in.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:30.92,0:06:36.01,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I realized you'd changed the day\N I saw you staring at Hinazuki in class.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:36.91,0:06:40.19,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I'd noticed her bruises long ago,
Dialogue: 10,0:06:41.01,0:06:44.06,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,but I couldn't do anything.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:44.68,0:06:46.06,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,That's how I always am.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:46.06,0:06:48.39,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I take a step back when dealing with people.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:49.06,0:06:53.90,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,But right in front of me, \Nyou dug deep and got closer to her.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:55.93,0:07:02.24,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,To me, it felt like something had taken control \Nof you to rebuke me and show me how it's done.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:03.70,0:07:06.79,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Satoru, just what are you?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:08.41,0:07:09.46,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I...
Dialogue: 10,0:07:10.85,0:07:12.30,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm...
Dialogue: 10,0:07:13.35,0:07:14.29,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I am...
Dialogue: 10,0:07:16.50,0:07:17.88,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,A superhero.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:19.93,0:07:21.83,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Rather, I want to be.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:30.00,0:07:32.73,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you're Satoru, all right.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:33.60,0:07:36.61,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Kenya, Hinazuki's going to be murdered.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:37.50,0:07:39.49,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I saw where she's physically abused.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:39.49,0:07:42.74,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Next time, I'll put an end to it for sure.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:44.12,0:07:45.48,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Satoru.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:45.48,0:07:49.87,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You don't become a superhero\Nafter achieving results.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:49.87,0:07:51.84,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You already are one.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:52.29,0:07:55.30,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Let me help you. I wanna be one too.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:55.30,0:07:56.97,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,A superhero.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:03.35,0:08:08.78,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\q2}I always thought you hated Hinazuki. \NLike how people dislike others similar to themselves.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:08.78,0:08:12.93,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I did hate her, but at the same time,\NI was attracted to something about her.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:13.81,0:08:16.81,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, I kinda get what you mean.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:19.86,0:08:21.79,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Satoru, Kenya.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:22.66,0:08:24.09,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Stand in the hallway with those buckets.{###}
Dialogue: 10,0:08:26.54,0:08:30.07,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Superheroes often end up with\Nthe short end of the stick, huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:30.07,0:08:31.08,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Tell me about it.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:32.64,0:08:34.46,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I need to stop by somewhere.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:34.46,0:08:37.97,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Hiromi, Kenya. Could you take Hinazuki\N to the kids' center and wait for me there?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:37.97,0:08:38.56,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:38.56,0:08:39.40,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:43.76,0:08:48.51,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I can get through tomorrow, March 1st,\Nif I don't leave Hinazuki alone in the park.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:49.02,0:08:53.09,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The problem is March 2nd,\Nthe day of our birthday party.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:55.26,0:08:57.20,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Yuuki-san needs an alibi.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:57.96,0:09:01.82,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, is your father's room on the ground floor?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:02.43,0:09:06.16,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Y-Yeah. It's at the corner facing the main street.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:06.66,0:09:07.61,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Why do you ask?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:07.61,0:09:11.29,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, I was just wondering if it was noisy at night.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:11.29,0:09:13.49,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,N-Not really, no.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:13.49,0:09:15.69,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}All right. One more thing...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:16.76,0:09:19.63,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Yuuki-san, do you ever see Hinazuki Kayo?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:20.51,0:09:23.09,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Wh-Why?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:24.06,0:09:26.85,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,She's been hanging out with our group lately.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:27.56,0:09:30.31,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,R-Really?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:30.31,0:09:33.58,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,No wonder I haven't seen her around for several days.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:42.03,0:09:44.24,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Way to go, Kayo-chan!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:44.24,0:09:46.20,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,That's darned great for her!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:46.64,0:09:50.29,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That's the first time I've ever\N heard Yuuki-san talk so informally.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:52.91,0:09:55.17,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,L-Laters, Satoru-kun.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:55.48,0:09:56.39,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Laters.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:59.00,0:10:00.45,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}From how Yuuki-san was acting,
Dialogue: 10,0:10:00.45,0:10:04.47,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}the killer must've seen him and Kayo together\Nby chance and decided to frame him.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:05.34,0:10:09.08,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Just you wait, Yuuki-san.\NI'm gonna prevent this entire case.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:10.46,0:10:13.73,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Hinazuki! Kenya! Hiromi?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:22.00,0:10:23.02,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Over here!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:23.74,0:10:26.26,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Satoru. We all decided to come here.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:26.26,0:10:28.41,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, Satoru! Join us!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:33.00,0:10:35.45,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I guess you can't play Othello with three people.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:36.25,0:10:38.36,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I need to be more careful.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:38.36,0:10:42.64,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I have to avoid radical changes\Nlike these until March 2nd,
Dialogue: 10,0:10:42.64,0:10:44.55,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}or else things could get unpredictable.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:49.08,0:10:50.14,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I'm home.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:54.04,0:10:55.18,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,One, two...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:55.18,0:10:59.65,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Satoru! Hinazuki! Happy birthday!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:00.51,0:11:05.07,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}After spending March 1st just like\Nlast time, X-Day is upon me again.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:08.23,0:11:11.24,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm gonna change the future \Nwith my actions from today on.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:11.81,0:11:14.25,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I forgot something at school.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:14.25,0:11:17.07,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You're going this late? Do you really need it now?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:17.07,0:11:18.08,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,See ya!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:18.08,0:11:21.53,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I know it seems unnatural, \Nbut now's not the time to care about that.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:34.96,0:11:36.08,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}This settles it!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:37.58,0:11:39.42,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Wh-What the hell?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:39.42,0:11:40.69,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Hey! Who did that?!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:40.69,0:11:45.09,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Now the police will serve as \NYuuki-san's alibi for tonight.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:56.43,0:11:57.96,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'll get rid of her.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:01.42,0:12:03.99,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}If I can keep her away from Hinazuki...
Dialogue: 10,0:12:09.38,0:12:10.80,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}If you would...
Dialogue: 10,0:12:11.80,0:12:12.85,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}just disappear...
Dialogue: 10,0:12:17.12,0:12:19.47,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Get a hold of yourself, Satoru.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:20.08,0:12:21.69,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,It'd be bad if she died.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:23.47,0:12:27.79,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,What's worse, you could get punished for it,\Nand then you wouldn't be able to help anyone.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:30.28,0:12:31.11,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Satoru...
Dialogue: 10,0:12:32.07,0:12:35.12,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I've been following you for the past two days or so.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:35.97,0:12:39.19,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Given how desperate you were to save Hinazuki,
Dialogue: 10,0:12:39.19,0:12:41.17,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I knew you wouldn't think twice\Nabout your own safety.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:43.73,0:12:45.10,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Kenya.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:45.70,0:12:49.65,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,But I really think Hinazuki's in danger today.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:51.44,0:12:55.05,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You did something rather concerning\Nbefore coming here, too.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:55.46,0:12:56.53,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,What was that all about?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:56.99,0:13:01.85,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Well, that was to call the cops \Nto that house for a different reason.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:09.11,0:13:12.30,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I've made up my mind. I need your help, Kenya.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:12.99,0:13:17.03,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Let's get the police to stop \NHinazuki's mother from abusing her.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:17.03,0:13:20.45,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,That could cause a big stir, you know.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:20.45,0:13:21.52,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:22.31,0:13:24.42,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Have you thought it through?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:24.42,0:13:29.24,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I just came up with the idea.\NI'll think about the fallout now.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:30.04,0:13:33.22,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I don't care if it becomes a major incident\Nor if I get caught midway.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:33.79,0:13:35.74,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I don't even care if I get punished for it.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:36.28,0:13:40.59,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,No matter what happens,\N anything's better than Hinazuki dying.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:41.67,0:13:44.44,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Just make sure you don't get caught.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:44.97,0:13:46.32,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,It'd make your mom sad.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:48.03,0:13:48.86,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Nah.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:49.19,0:13:52.55,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Knowing my mom, she'd be proud of me.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:52.55,0:13:54.61,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I can see that.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:54.96,0:13:56.40,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Okay, let's do this.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:58.72,0:14:00.70,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna go walk Hinazuki home.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:00.70,0:14:01.60,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Get going.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:01.60,0:14:03.40,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,We'll clean up here.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:05.41,0:14:08.48,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I remembered to wear my coat \Nand gloves when leaving home this time.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:10.22,0:14:11.24,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Hinazuki...
Dialogue: 10,0:14:10.22,0:14:11.24,GJM_Overlap,,0,0,0,,Fujinuma...
Dialogue: 10,0:14:12.84,0:14:14.05,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Listen...
Dialogue: 10,0:14:14.42,0:14:17.88,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna kidnap you now. Okay?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:22.08,0:14:23.52,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Are you stupid?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:23.99,0:14:26.90,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,That I am. \NThat's why I couldn't think of anything else.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:32.14,0:14:32.95,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:37.27,0:14:38.96,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I had a feeling you'd say that.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:45.13,0:14:46.05,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Here we are.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:47.46,0:14:49.43,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,A disused school bus.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:49.95,0:14:52.60,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I hear it was the clubroom for \NIzumi Elementary's hockey team.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:54.98,0:14:56.80,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Hey. So you two came.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:56.80,0:14:59.08,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah. You sure this is gonna be okay?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:59.08,0:15:03.77,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Yep. They got a new bus last year,\Nso this is just used for storage now.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:06.63,0:15:08.95,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Let's open the vents before lighting the heater.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:12.23,0:15:13.48,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,It's all rusted.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:18.08,0:15:20.26,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Try not to make it too obvious.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:20.26,0:15:21.33,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:25.72,0:15:26.81,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:26.81,0:15:27.80,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Whoa.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:27.80,0:15:32.01,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,This is a pretty cool hideout.\NI wouldn't mind living here myself.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:32.01,0:15:33.80,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Doesn't have a bath, though.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:34.39,0:15:37.43,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Living in a big house doesn't\Nalways mean you'll be happy.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:40.11,0:15:42.72,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Even so, I still gotta go home.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:42.72,0:15:44.45,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Later, Hinazuki.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:44.45,0:15:47.06,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I need to go home now too, \Nbut I'll be back later in the night.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:47.42,0:15:48.85,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I'll knock three times, okay?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:52.46,0:15:55.65,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Satoru, Kenya-kun.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:55.65,0:15:58.72,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,No need for thanks. \N Just doing what friends do, Kayo-chan.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:58.72,0:16:01.12,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,We'll protect you no matter what, Kayo.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:07.03,0:16:07.54,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Ow.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:07.54,0:16:09.19,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,"Kayo"? Really?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:09.19,0:16:12.07,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,That was embarrassing for me too.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:12.07,0:16:13.71,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Besides, you also called her that.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:13.71,0:16:16.21,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's kinda hard to call her that.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:16.21,0:16:17.30,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I'll go with "Hina."
Dialogue: 10,0:16:17.73,0:16:19.30,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You should be the only one to call her "Kayo."
Dialogue: 10,0:16:21.92,0:16:23.26,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:23.26,0:16:25.47,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Like I said, no need for thanks.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:25.47,0:16:28.70,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Besides, the hard part's only just starting, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:28.70,0:16:29.69,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:30.38,0:16:34.84,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,If this ends up becoming public,\Nact like you know nothing.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:35.47,0:16:36.48,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Got it.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:41.70,0:16:43.76,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You sure took your sweet time.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:43.76,0:16:44.45,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:44.78,0:16:48.09,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,We took a detour and talked about stuff.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:49.79,0:16:53.83,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Did Hinazuki's mom call by any chance?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:53.83,0:16:56.00,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Nope. Not a peep.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:56.00,0:16:59.95,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, right. I've got an early start tomorrow,\Nso you don't have to stay up.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:01.22,0:17:02.72,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I'll make do with this for food.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:24.89,0:17:25.66,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Come in.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:28.70,0:17:30.17,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You were up?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:30.17,0:17:31.62,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I couldn't sleep.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:31.62,0:17:33.40,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Figures.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:33.40,0:17:34.35,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Are you hungry?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:42.69,0:17:43.51,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,This is great.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:46.51,0:17:48.77,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Cup noodles make a good late-night snack, huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:49.47,0:17:51.95,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,It's the first time I've had a night like this.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:51.95,0:17:54.22,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I'd be surprised if you had.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:57.46,0:18:00.77,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I'm planning a camping trip with Kenya\Nand the guys for the summer.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:01.37,0:18:02.77,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You should come.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:03.58,0:18:04.86,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I don't know if I can...
Dialogue: 10,0:18:04.86,0:18:05.87,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You can.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:19.92,0:18:21.18,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Wake up.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:22.31,0:18:23.42,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,It's morning.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:30.31,0:18:32.06,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Good thing I dropped by.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:32.06,0:18:34.79,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Let's leave before the Izumi Elementary kids come.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:36.98,0:18:39.94,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Kayo's late?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:46.26,0:18:51.16,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,This is the lunch broadcast.\NPlease wash your hands before eating.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:52.24,0:18:55.07,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Nothing's happened so far.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:55.07,0:18:59.07,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\q2}What do you make of it? \NWould Hinazuki's mom have called the police already?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:59.78,0:19:02.13,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I don't think she'll look for her just yet.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:03.04,0:19:07.43,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Last time, on March 2nd, \NHinazuki got back home at 9 p.m.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:07.80,0:19:10.23,GJM_Main,,15,0,0,,{\i1}After that, her mother and \Nher mother's boyfriend beat her.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:10.82,0:19:14.39,GJM_Main,,15,0,0,,{\i1}Before 11 p.m., she disappeared\Nfrom the shed they'd locked her in.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:15.00,0:19:18.65,GJM_Main,,15,0,0,,{\i1}At 12:30 a.m., Hinazuki's mom called mine.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:19.60,0:19:23.11,GJM_Main,,15,0,0,,{\i1}The culprit murdered Hinazuki\Nbefore sunrise on the 3rd.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:23.11,0:19:26.45,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Not only have Hinazuki's actions\Nand ours changed a lot this time,
Dialogue: 10,0:19:26.45,0:19:30.03,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}but so have Hinazuki's mom's,\Nand the killer's.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:30.55,0:19:32.37,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Everything from now on is uncharted territory.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:35.60,0:19:39.42,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,This is Yashiro Gaku.\N I'm a teacher at Mikoto Elementary School.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:40.16,0:19:42.32,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Yes, please.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:46.46,0:19:48.75,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Don't tell Kazu or Osamu about this.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:48.75,0:19:51.60,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,And, uh, sorry for dragging you into this, Hiromi.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:51.60,0:19:56.16,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I'm just glad you asked me for help, no matter how.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:56.16,0:19:59.71,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,And even if I'd gone home, \NI would've been all by myself until 8 p.m.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:00.44,0:20:03.23,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Sorry for cooping you up in here, too, Kayo.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:03.23,0:20:06.53,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Don't be. I've never had this much fun before.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:07.17,0:20:08.94,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I'm glad I mustered up the courage to come.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:09.90,0:20:12.03,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna drop by your place tomorrow morning.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:12.50,0:20:15.17,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,And leave her mom with no choice\Nbut to call the cops, huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:15.17,0:20:15.73,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:16.29,0:20:20.62,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Listen, I more or less get the gist of it,\Nbut who's gonna handle the fallout?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:20.62,0:20:23.99,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Don't worry. I'll take full responsibility.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:26.20,0:20:27.21,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Are you stupid?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:27.93,0:20:32.53,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,If we say it was my idea, \Nand you guys only helped me out...
Dialogue: 10,0:20:36.35,0:20:38.76,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,we all get away scot-free, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:38.76,0:20:40.44,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,There, I win.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:41.44,0:20:42.87,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,She's right.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:42.87,0:20:44.44,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I never even considered that angle.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:45.05,0:20:49.74,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}On the way home, Kenya said,\N"I bet you hadn't thought of that."
Dialogue: 10,0:20:50.40,0:20:52.52,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}When I told him I hadn't, he added...
Dialogue: 10,0:20:53.63,0:20:56.19,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"In my eyes, that's what heroes are like."
Dialogue: 10,0:21:11.82,0:21:14.31,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Is that Satoru?
